      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow6:140",
        "answer": "Takes menu f1_arg0, controller f1_arg1 and eight layout bounds f1_arg2..f1_arg9; calls LUI.UIElement.new and sets the literal class/id/sound. Creates ProgressBar and Robot children. Escort.robotProgress delivery sets Robot's left percentage only for non-nil model values. GlobalModel Escort.robotObjective delivery calls SetEscortRobotObjective with self.ProgressBar. Registers self's close pointer. The shown direct statements configure UI children and contain no direct gameplay-robot movement request. Opaque child/provider calls and optional PostLoadFunc38..40 leave their effects open; HMH use of this escort path remains unproved. Exact child order: ProgressBar, Robot. All layout/property/asset values and each callback body are retained in the ordered trace. Calls the optional same-file-or-unresolved PostLoadFunc at its exact source position, then returns self; a same name in another file  [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
        "unknowns": [
          "Effective HMH settings/data/assets, true load/overwrite/class lookup order, original recovered-text fidelity, native callback delivery and service/server implementations remain open.",
          "Independent correctness review and final game tests remain deferred."
        ],
        "status": "complete_bounded_contract"
